  {
    "id": "b10f7099a2118cf07cf96f0ee758779f64336a4e",
    "title": "separated model support as well",
    "message": "\n\nIt turns out that some devices, particularly iphones can't support the fused melEncoder model\nwe end up with this error: \n\n\n  - The fused MelEncoder takes raw waveform as input with shape [1, 240000] (15 s \u00d7 16 kHz). In Core ML\u2019s internal NCHW mapping this becomes N1D1C1H1W240000. A15\u2019s ANE (E5)\n  rejects any single dimension > 16384, so W=240000 triggers: \u201cInvalid layer: Tensor dimensions \u2026 W240000 \u2026 W[1\u201316384]\u201d.",
    "authors": [
      {
        "user": "bweng",
        "avatar": "https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/6722a3d5150ed6c830d8f0cd/-1C1dhuh9rZJbcVkluv52.jpeg"
      }
    ],
    "date": "2025-09-21T04:00:11.000Z"
  },
